  "all_ingredients_flat": "cabbage, potato, onion, coarsely ground rolled oats, brown rice powder, chickpea flour, hing (asafoetida), turmeric powder, garlic powder, green cardamom powder, mustard powder, black pepper, lemon juice, sesame seeds, garlic cloves, green chili",
  "instructions": "Combine all ingredients & knead into a dough that is neither too soft nor too hard, using some water if required.\nMake small balls with the dough. If the balls are sticky, use 2-3 drops of water.\nBake the balls an air fryer at 180 C for 20 mins, then turn them over and bake for 10 more mins.\nAdd spices of your choice. We may add crushed garlic cloves & green chili too.\nServe with chutneys like Mint Cilantro Chutney and Amla Date Chutney!",
  "cooking_methods": [
    "bake",
    "no-cook"
  ],
  "serving_suggestion": "Serve with chutneys like Mint Cilantro Chutney and Amla Date Chutney!",
